0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zbaBwAo-UGWZPTvbJVV9Iw","review_id":"ACUoLYzaPXlYIJSCIzGqjQ","date":"2019-12-11T19:32:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9302935004234314,"text_excerpt":"Went here for the first time in WHILE recently and it's still pretty tasty. Fries and onion rings are solid and the burgers are always delicious. Catfish and shrimp are good options as well. I get the feeling the staff means well, but customer service/cleanliness leaves a little to be desired. The price is a bit high if you consider this \"fast food\" but the portions are huge and flavor is better than quicker options. All in all, good quick dinner option."},{"business_id":"zbaBwAo-UGWZPTvbJVV9Iw","review_id":"wyd9xRVIJjcuYqLonpOB0g","date":"2020-01-07T03:04:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9249014854431152,"text_excerpt":"I always enjoy the food here. I usually get the BBQ shrimp poboy but got the Roadhouse Burger cooked medium. Sadly it came well but it still had a great taste. Fries always has a nice crisp with the aioli. Service is always prompt and our waitress Candy was efficient and attentive."},{"business_id":"zbaBwAo-UGWZPTvbJVV9Iw","review_id":"XyamsH4BMB8VJ2nFn2v8BQ","date":"2012-07-14T16:18:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9247612357139587,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the best burger joints here in the big Easy! I tried their cajun burger it was delicious and I also liked those garlic fries that came with it. After eating at this place it makes me want more. I definitely like the fact that this place is close to where I live. The service was rather mediocre though. But all in all it was a great dining experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zbaBwAo-UGWZPTvbJVV9Iw","photo_id":"duFr247hMoHLftxSjklY7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/duFr247hMoHLftxSjklY7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8964165449142456},{"business_id":"zbaBwAo-UGWZPT